t-news/what-are-mel-brooks-favorite-movies-to-celebrate-100th-birthday-comedy-legend-picks-20-films-to-screen-across-los-angeles-180989410/</guid></item><item><title>阿拉巴马州一家与民权运动有关的历史悠久的酒店正在倒塌。为拯救它而奋斗的环保主义者能否扭转局势？</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/historic-alabama-hotel-linked-civil-rights-movement-is-falling-apart-can-conservationists-fighting-to-save-it-turn-the-tide-180989407/</link><description>塞尔玛的埃迪斯通酒店见证了美国历史上的关键篇章，从重建到“血腥星期日”。现在，经过多年的忽视和最近的围墙倒塌，保护基金正在努力确保其未来</description><pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 18:35:02 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/historic-alabama-hotel-linked-civil-rights-movement-is-falling-apart-can-conservationists-fighting-to-save-it-turn-the-tide-180989407/</guid></item><item><title>为什么这位 17 世纪波兰妇女的脚趾上挂着挂锁，脖子上挂着一把铁镰刀？</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/why-was-this-17th-century-polish-woman-buried-with-a-padlock-on-her-toe-and-an-iron-sickle-across-her-neck-180989408/</link><description>新的研究表明，埋葬这名年轻女子的人采取了预防措施，以阻止她复活并对他们进行报复</description><pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 17:51:52 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/why-was-this-17th-century-polish-woman-buried-with-a-padlock-on-her-toe-and-an-iron-sickle-across-her-neck-180989408/</guid></item><item><title>古生物学家在拉布雷亚焦油坑发现了一种新的冰河时代蟾蜍，为该地区古代气候提供了线索</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/paleontologists-discover-a-new-species-of-ice-age-toad-at-the-la-brea-tar-pits-offering-clues-about-the-areas-ancient-climate-180989390/</link><description>这些化石遗骸于 1929 年被发现，是拉布雷亚研究相对较少的两栖动物收藏的一部分。由于蟾蜍是冷血动物并且对环境变化敏感，这一发现可以帮助研究人员拼凑出过去的气候条件</description><pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 15:37:27 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/paleontologists-discover-a-new-species-of-ice-age-toad-at-the-la-brea-tar-pits-offering-clues-about-the-areas-ancient-climate-180989390/</guid></item><item><title>Freddie Mercury 突破界限的服装成为维多利亚和阿尔伯特博物馆的焦点，纪念他诞辰 80 周年<