o-the-night-skies-this-week-to-see-a-near-total-lunar-eclipse-itll-temporarily-turn-the-moon-red-180989404/</link><description>在高峰期，月球 96% 的面积将位于地球阴影最暗的部分内。由于阳光穿过地球大气层，该球体将呈现出怪异的光芒</description><pubDate>Wed, 26 Aug 2026 18:57:29 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/turn-your-eyes-to-the-night-skies-this-week-to-see-a-near-total-lunar-eclipse-itll-temporarily-turn-the-moon-red-180989404/</guid></item><item><title>2200 年前的罗马沉船上的易碎涂层揭示了古代水手如何使船只保持漂浮</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/brittle-coating-on-2200-year-old-roman-shipwreck-revealing-how-ancient-soliders-kept-ships-afloat-180989394/</link><description>船上保存的松焦油和蜂蜡的痕迹揭示了几千年前造船厂用来保护船只免受深海侵蚀的艰苦技术</description><pubDate>Wed, 26 Aug 2026 18:45:17 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/brittle-coating-on-2200-year-old-roman-shipwreck-revealing-how-ancient-soliders-kept-ships-afloat-180989394/</guid></item><item><title>查看年度野生动物摄影师奖中的 16 张令人惊叹的动物照片</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/see-16-stunning-animal-images-from-the-wildlife-photographer-of-the-year-awards-180989397/</link><description>这项著名的比赛现已进入第 62 个年头，在 10 月份宣布获奖者之前，先睹为快地公布了本次比赛的参赛作品</description><pubDate>Wed, 26 Aug 2026 18:28:04 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/see-16-stunning-animal-images-from-the-wildlife-photographer-of-the-year-awards-180989397/</guid></item><item><title>这些中世纪手稿碎片被重新用作羊皮纸，无意中将它们保存了几个世纪</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/these-medieval-manuscript-fragments-were-reused-as-parchment-inadvertently-preserving-them-for-centuries-180989398/</link><description>最近在海峡群岛之一根西岛发现的这些书页包括圣经段落、诗歌、戏剧和其他文本。它们在 16 世纪和 17 世纪被重新用作书籍装订</description><pubDate>Wed, 26 Aug 2026 18:20:50 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/these-medieval-manuscript-fragments-were-reused-as-parchment-inadvertently-preserving-them-for-centuries-180989398/</guid></item><item><title>迭戈·马拉多纳世界杯“上帝之手”进球所用的足球在拍卖会上以 335 万美元的价格售出</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/soccer-ball-used-for-diego-maradona-hand-of-god-world-cup-goal-sells-at-auction-180989392/</link><description>尽管它在足球历史上最著名的比赛之一中发挥了重要作用，但这件具有历史意义的体育纪念品的售价仍低于 1000 万美元的预售估价</description><pubDate>Wed, 26 Aug 2026 17:02:31 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/soccer-ball-used-for-diego-maradona-hand-of-god-world-cup-goal-sells-at-auction-180989392/</guid></item><item><title>这种致命的贝类中毒没有解药。美国牛蛙中发现的一种蛋白质可能会改变这一现状</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/this-deadly-shellfish-poisoning-has-no-antidote-a-protein-found-in-american-bullfrogs-could-change-that-180989365/</link><description>一项针对小鼠的研究发现，一种名为亲蛤蚌毒素蛋白的蛋白质就像海绵一样，可以抵抗藻华产生的致命毒素。这种有害物质在某些海鲜中积累，可能会导致一种危及生命的疾病，称为麻痹性贝类中毒</description><pubDate>Wed, 26 Aug 2026 15:39:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/this-deadly-shellfish-poisoning-has-no-antidote-a-protein-found-in-american-bullfrogs-could-change-that-180989365/</guid></item><item><title>仍在建造中的新望远镜意外揭示了垂死恒星如何将物质带回太空</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/a-new-telescope-still-under-construction-accidentally-reveals-how-a-dying-star-returns-matter-to-space-180989349/</link><description>研究人员在校准位于智利的名为 MOTHRA 的仪器时捕获了前所未有的恒星回收过程图像，该仪器预计将于 2026 年底完成</description><pubDate>Wed, 26 Aug 2026 14:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/a-new-telescope-still-under-construction-accidentally-reveals-how-a-dying-star-returns-matter-to-space-180989349/</guid></item><item><title>“饥饿石”在欧洲重新出现，随着河流跌至历史低点，数百年前的警告重新出现在人们的视野中</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/hunger-stones-resurface-europe-bringing-centuries-old-warnings-back-into-view-rivers-hit-historic-lows-180989387/</link><description>随着干旱使中欧大片河床裸露，过去几代人雕刻的记录低水位的标记再次出现</description><pubDate>Wed, 26 Aug 2026 11:45:00 GMT</pubDate>